add r0 r0 r6
put d0 21 r6
put d0 23 r0
get r1 d0 24
bne r1 r0 Loop
get r2 d0 25
get r3 d0 26
get r4 d0 27
beq r6 3 CreateReply
beq r6 5 CreateReply
